&lt;p&gt;# Comments: 1&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49967266</guid><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:47:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Show HN: Made a xcom like game in a weekend with AI. 3D, textures, models, etc.</title><link>https://playgama.ai/play/55p62bkfsc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;I published it to playgama, but first want to say how it helped me. One of my ideas was to make something like X-Com but provide an indirect control - you control the leader, and your squad members make the turns themselves, based on their intelligence stats! If they get alive over battles - they learn how to play smarter, not just to get MORE hp!&lt;p&gt;Now the most interesting part - the development. I used three.js and vanilla js, no engines or frameworks at all. The  critical part was to get the story, organize self testing process - game is challenging, units are clear, gameplay brings joy, no UI mistakes, etc. Other important part was to use subagents which focus on different tasks, AI downloaded the blender and music generator and provided enough of cool features to the game.&lt;p&gt;I am really proud of what I can achieve in 2-3 days , I played it myself over 10 times and every time I was enjoying it. not AAA, but can compete with indies.&lt;/p&gt;
